            "review_title": "Review at Finn Lounge",
            "review_text": "Huy Nguyen\nNinh Binh, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nAmazing\nApr 2026 • Couples\nWe were staying at the hotel and the front desk recommended Finn Restaurant on the first floor for our anniversary dinner. It was a great recommendation!\n\nWe ordered the anniversary set, and everything was beautifully presented and tasted amazing. It was such a thoughtful way to celebrate our special day. The staff were warm, attentive, and made us feel very welcome without being over the top.\n\nOverall, we had a lovely evening and would definitely recommend Finn to other couples staying at the hotel or anyone looking for a nice place to celebrate a special occasion.\nRead more\nWritten July 4, 2026",
